namco_62xx: Namco 62XX (CUS62) custom chip wrapper for the Rodimus MiSTer cores (first used in Arcade-Namco6809,
Gaplus, 2026-11-11). The 62XX is a Fujitsu MB88 in a 28-pin package with Namco's program in its mask ROM; this
wrapper maps its package pins onto the fleet MB88 (rodimus mb88). Written from the Gaplus schematic (gaplus-1.pdf);
MAME src/mame/namco/namco62.cpp (copyright-holders: Philip Bennett) only identifies the part, no code is derived
from it.

Everything in this chip folder is distributed under the BSD 3-Clause License below.

